    "README says Linux shared memory not working in this release; same machine and same OS required, WSL excluded",
    "README warns lidar can crash simulator and BeamNGpy is not threadsafe",
    "VehicleNode uses MultiThreadedExecutor; this does not establish safe BeamNGpy parallelism",
    "Sensor static TF ignores up and snapping/deformation; quaternion helper returns non-unit w=0.1 for parallel/opposite directions",
