    "Vehicle TF uses cached bbox-center offset; not a validated rear-axle base_link",
    "Timer nanosecond fraction uses 1e6 rather than 1e9",
    "IMU covariances mark all fields unavailable",
    "Cosimulation configured on construction disables normal vehicle sensor polling",
    "Agent brake-only changes do not trigger its value-change-gated control publishing"
